      "description": "BLOCKED FINDING, left unconverted deliberately: no player can reach this state. After the hauler above, cash is short of a drill rig, so the Fleet panel correctly disables its buy button — but `vehicle buy` subtracts the cost unconditionally and drives cash negative, so command mode succeeds where the UI refuses. `research queue`, `employee train` and `survey` all reject an unaffordable purchase; `vehicle buy`, `employee hire` and `build` do not. Filed as a separate finding rather than papered over with a click that cannot land (.claude/rules/playability.md)."
